    probably one more change that i forgot, wwhatever

Version 0.2.0 (2026-06-23):
    made the dereference require bracket (so i can have expressinos and not just normal vars)and made dereferences use an astnode and not a string
    added a way to debug tokens
    fixed this big error with function defenition parsing
    added unless keyword
    added <=, >=, and !=

Version 0.3.0 (2026-06-26):
    added 'not' and 'and' keywords
    added bracket support to parse_expression
    made groupingnode
    updated my horrible error system and made it a bit less horrible
    added 'elif' and 'else' statements

Version 0.3.1 (2026-06-30):
    added ability to make array-type pointers (pretty useless though)
    made strings use std::string
    moved some builtins h funcs into the builtins.px

